#AREA Elven Camp~

#AUTHORS Haxl~

#HELPS
0 $~

#RANGES 0 99 10 95

#FLAGS AFLAG_NODEBUG|AFLAG_NOTELEPORT

#MOBILES
#400
guard elf elven~
The Elven Guard~
There is an elf here attacking intruders on sight.~
The typical elf like slenderness and agility make this elf a tough opponent.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_INFRARED
1000 S
95 BODY_ARM BODY_FOOT 10000d1+5000 10d10+80
10000 RACE_ELF
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
if race($n) == RACE_ELF
  smile $n
  say Welcome fellow elf
else
  growl $n
  say Die Intruder!
  mpkill $n
endif
~
>fight_prog 100~
if rand(40)
  cast 'acid blast' $n
else
  kick $n
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
say We shall arise and be triumphant......
say You shall never kill us off foreign scum!
mpquiet on
mass 'acid blast'
mass 'acid blast'
mass 'curse'
mpquiet off
~
|
