#402
ethereal_1~
Elven ethereal mob~
What long desc ?~
Loads up guards on the entrance of a non-elf
purges them occasionally to prevent a buildup of fuckloads of guards~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_ETHEREAL
