95 BODY_ARM BODY_FOOT 10000d1+5000 10d10+80
10000 RACE_ELF
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
#403
ethereal_1~
Elven ethereal mob~
What long desc ?~
Loads up guards on the entrance of a non-elf
purges them occasionally to prevent a buildup of fuckloads of guards~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_ETHEREAL
1000 S
95 BODY_ARM BODY_FOOT 10000d1+5000 10d10+80
10000 RACE_ELF
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if race($n) == 2
  break
else
  mpmload 401
  rescale 401 $n 160
  mpforce guard mpkill $n
endif
~
>rand_prog 4~
mpquiet on
mppurge guard
mpquiet off
~
|
