#409
elf elven king high~
The Elven High-King~
The High-King is sitting on his throne here.~
To fight this elf would mean instant death.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN
1000 S
95 BODY_HEAD BODY_HEAD 1d1+9999 1d1+99
10000 RACE_ELF
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>fight_prog 100~
laugh $n
~
>greet_prog 100~
if race($n) == 2
  smile $n
  mpechoat $n The Elven High-King says 'So $n, Are YOU interested in joining the Army then ?'
else
  say BEGONE! HEATHEN!
  mptransfer $n 9755
endif
~
>speech_prog worthy chance.~
if quest(0,4,$n) == 1
  mpmset $n quest 0 4 2
  say Well I suppose that is so.
  say But, You must not let the nation down.
  say I will give you an ENLISTMENT PAPER to sign, if you are really that keen.
endif
~
>speech_prog enlistment paper~
if quest(0,4,$n) == 2
  mpmset $n quest 0 4 3
  say here it is so.....
  mpoload 400
  mpquiet on
  cast 'giant strength' $n
  mpquiet off
  give enlistment $n
  mpjunk enlistment
else
  say You must leave now!
  mpforce $n south
endif
~
>speech_prog resign~
if armystatus($n) == 1
 say You wish to leave us then.
 frown $n
 say So be it.
 mpoload 428
 mpquiet on
 cast 'giant strength' $n
 mpquiet off
 give paper $n
 mpjunk paper 
else
 say You are not in the army!
 mptransfer $n 9755
endif
~
|
