95 BODY_HEAD BODY_HEAD 1d1+9999 1d1+99
10000 RACE_ELF
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
>fight_prog 100~
Unknown $n
~
>greet_prog 100~
if race($n) == 2
  emote looks up from what she was reading. 
endif
~
>speech_prog yes~
say We are very selective about who we let in and who we reject.
say How do We know that YOU are worthy of a chance to kill our blood enemies?
mpmset $n quest 0 4 1
~
