#423
The Throne Room~
You are standing at the throne of the king and queen of your race. There are 
multiple adornments along each wall, which may be symbols of power, indicating
how much of the knowledge from the past has been forgotten, because there is 
nobody alive that is able to use them. The throne that the king and queen sit 
upon is carved out of an absolutely massive piece of dead oak. The wood seems 
too have been polished using the finest oils, and molded to the touch of the
elven craftsmen that made it. You feel a great need to pay homage to the 
persons sitting upon the throne here.~
